<title>AUSTRALIA: Rural Property suspended before conversion.</title>
<headline>Rural Property suspended before conversion.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX) said on Tuesday the securities of Rural Property Trust will be suspended from official quotation from the close of trading on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The ASX said the suspension follows the unitholders' decision to convert the trust into a corporate structure.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
